# Docker & Infraestrutura — ZyraVision

## Docker Compose (MVP)
Servicos obrigatorios:
- `app` — Laravel + PHP-FPM
- `web` — Nginx
- `db` — PostgreSQL 15
- `redis` — Redis 7
- `media` — MediaMTX + FFmpeg
- `queue` — Laravel Horizon (worker)
- `scheduler` — Laravel Scheduler

## Imagens Base
- PHP: `php:8.2-fpm-alpine`
- Node: `node:20-alpine` (build)
- Nginx: `nginx:alpine`
- PostgreSQL: `postgres:15-alpine`
- Redis: `redis:7-alpine`

## Multi-stage Build

```dockerfile
# Build frontend
FROM node:20-alpine AS frontend
WORKDIR /app
COPY package*.json ./
RUN npm ci
COPY . .
RUN npm run build

# Build backend
FROM php:8.2-fpm-alpine AS app
# ... instalar extensoes
COPY --from=frontend /app/public/build /app/public/build
```

## Volumes
- `/storage/app` — uploads e cache
- `/storage/recordings` — gravacoes de video
- PostgreSQL data em volume nomeado
- Redis data em volume nomeado

## Redes
- `frontend` — Nginx + App
- `backend` — App + DB + Redis
- `media` — App + MediaMTX + FFmpeg

## GPU (quando disponivel)
- Usar `nvidia-container-toolkit`
- `deploy.resources.reservations.devices: [gpu]`
- Container AI separado com acesso GPU

## Health Checks
- TODOS os servicos com healthcheck
- Intervalo: 30s
- Timeout: 10s
- Retries: 3

## Ambiente
- `.env` para configuracao (NUNCA commitar)
- `.env.example` com todas as variaveis documentadas
- Secrets via Docker Secrets em producao
